  "id": "perfect-order-build-battle-box",
  "name": "Perfect Order Build & Battle Box",
  "category": "product_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "Given to players at the Perfect Order prerelease tournaments on the weekends of 14–15 and 21–22 March 2026. Each box held four Perfect Order booster packs and a 40-card deck built around one of four promos with the Perfect Order logo. The decks also held non-holo copies of Serperior, Landorus, Tyrantrum, Growing Grass Energy and Rocky Fighting Energy, which booster packs have only in holofoil.",
